WEBVTT

00:00:01.777 --> 00:00:03.777
Step 1: Verify the starting page

00:00:02.038 --> 00:00:04.038
Step 2: Click rename affordance for the first project row

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:05.890
Step 3: Clear the inline 'Project name' field in the renaming row

00:00:04.587 --> 00:00:06.587
Step 4: Type the project's new name into the inline 'Project name' field

00:00:05.243 --> 00:00:08.645
Step 5: Click the row's Save control to commit the rename
